---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About" currentPage="/about">
	<div class="about-container">
		<div>
			<h1>About Me</h1>
			<img src="/avatar/mochi_full_body.PNG" alt="Mochi Art Avatar" class="art-avatar"/>
		</div>
		
		<div class="about-content">
			<p>
				Heya, I'm Mochi! I love to create all sorts of artwork and I'm always trying to improve my skills. I'm also a Computer Science grad so this whole site is fun lil project of mine using Astro, TypeScript, and JavaScript as the main languages. 
			</p>
			
			<h2>My Artistic Journey</h2>
			<p>
				I have been doodling since I was a kid but started taking art seriously in 2014. Ever since then I have explored TONS of different styles and techniques, mediums, and subjects to enhance my art.
			</p>
			
			<h2>What I Like to Depict</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>Original Characters</li>
				<li>Random Doodles (I love practicing textures and linework)</li>
				<li>Studies of Landscapes, Animals, and Portraits</li>
				<li>Story-Driven Illustrations (rare haha)</li>
			</ul>

			<h2>Tools of the Trade</h2>
			<p>While I've worked with Acrylic and Oil paints in the past, I'm definitely a digital guy at heart. This is what I use to create:</p>
			<div class="about-section">
				<h4>I make art with:</h4>
				<ul>
					<li>Tablet: iPad mini 6</li>
					<li>Utensil: Apple Pencil 2</li>
					<li>App: Procreate</li>
					<li>ibisPaint (for phone art. I draw with my fingers)</li>
				</ul>

				<h4>And I edit my Youtube videos with:</h4>
				<ul>
					<li>Main: DaVinci Resolve</li>
					<li>Recording: OBS</li>
					<li>PNGtuber Rigging: VeadoTube Mini</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<h2>Get in Touch</h2>
			<p>
				Interested in commissioning a piece or learning more about my work? 
				<a href="/contact">Contact me</a> to discuss!
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	h1 {
		text-align: center;
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.about-section {
		background-color: #ffffff8a;
		padding: 1rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
	}

	.about-container {
		display: flex;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.about-content {
		line-height: 1.8;
		background-color: #ffffffd7;
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 15px;

	}

	.about-content p {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		color: #444;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.about-content h2 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		color: #000;
	}

	.about-content ul {
		list-style: none;
		padding-left: 0;
	}

	.about-content li {
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		position: relative;
	}

	.about-content li::before {
		content: "→";
		position: absolute;
		left: 0.5%;
		color: #000;
		font-weight: bold;
	}

	.about-content a {
		color: #000;
		text-decoration: underline;
		font-weight: 600;
		transition: color 0.3s ease;
	}

	.about-content a:hover {
		color: #666;
	}
	.art-avatar {
		display: block;
		margin: 0 auto 2rem auto;
		max-width: 70%;
		height: auto;
		object-fit: contain;
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.art-avatar{
			display: none
		}
		.about-container{
			display: block;
		}
	}
</style>